---

### Final Thought

Building a frontend for an e‑commerce site is a marathon, not a sprint. Start with a solid foundation (design system + component library), keep your code modular, and automate everything you can (tests, linting, CI/CD). Once you have the skeleton, iterate fast on real user feedback—your customers will thank you for a smooth, delightful shopping experience! 🚀

Happy coding!
